        <mxCell id="note" parent="1" style="shape=note;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;size=14;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=8;spacingTop=4;fontSize=10;fillColor=#fffde7;strokeColor=#b0a060;" value="&lt;b&gt;Constraints&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;• photographer / client: a User whose role is PHOTOGRAPHER / CLIENT.&lt;br&gt;• The role can change: a client may open a studio and become a photographer.&lt;br&gt;• Each booking, quote, invoice, project, equipment, event and team member belongs to one photographer.&lt;br&gt;• A booking becomes a project only once it is confirmed.&lt;br&gt;• A project is delivered only once it is paid.&lt;br&gt;• A team member only sees the projects assigned to them." vertex="1">
